        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger An ally within 60 feet fails a saving throw\n\n---\nEffect The ally improves its result by one degree of success, turning a failure into a success or a critical failure into a normal failure. The dragon can't use this ability again for 1d4 rounds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Powerful Utterance",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The dragon expresses their power in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Powerful Utterance again for 1d4 rounds.\n- Ardent Proclamation (occult, fire) The dragon breathes a blast of flame in a 40-foot cone that deals 16d6 fire damage (DC 36 basic Reflex save save).\n- Chastising Word (mental, occult) The dragon chides the targets strictly enough to leave the mind reeling. Each creature within a 40-foot cone must succeed at a DC 36 Will save save or become Stupefied 2 for 1 minute (or Stupefied 3 on a critical failure)."
    },
